From cae9603f64fae027d204a09db9ac69eabeb810f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:43:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: adopt S+Play logo, add Splash, Onboarding, Screen Time
 & Sleep Timer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Logo & Brand:
- Replace ic_launcher_foreground.xml with S+Play logo (red S ribbon + white play triangle)
- Replace ic_logo.xml with compact S+Play for top bar
- Change launcher background to dark (#0F0F0F)

Splash Screen:
- Add core-splashscreen dependency
- Create splash_background.xml with S+Play on dark
- Add Theme.SukainaTube.Splash theme
- Install SplashScreen API in MainActivity

Onboarding Wizard:
- Create OnboardingActivity (3 steps: welcome → PIN setup → done)
- Add onboarding_completed flag to SettingsStore
- Redirect to onboarding on first launch from MainActivity

Screen Time:
- Add dailyLimitMinutes, todayWatchedMinutes, lastWatchDate to SettingsStore
- Add Screen Time section in ParentSettingsActivity with daily limit dialog
- Track watching time in WatchActivity (1 minute interval)
- Auto-pause when daily limit reached

Sleep Timer:
- Add Sleep Timer button in player controls
- Add showSleepTimerDialog() in WatchActivity
- Options: 5/10/15/30/45/60/90 minutes
- Auto-pause when timer expires
